$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$
$ LS-DYNA KEYWORD DECK: STEEL CYLINDER WITH DOMED ENDS & LEAD CORE FILL
$ 100% HIGH-QUALITY CONFORMING HEX8 SOLID MESH (EXPLICIT TRANSIENT FEA)
$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$
$ Geometry Specifications:
$   - Overall Length: 300.0 mm (0.300 m)
$   - Outer Diameter: 75.0 mm (0.075 m) -> Outer Radius = 37.5 mm
$   - Wall Thickness: 6.0 mm (0.006 m)  -> Inner Radius = 31.5 mm
$   - Domed Ends: Cubed-Sphere Hex8 Hemispherical Caps (R_out = 37.5 mm)
$   - Cylindrical Section Length: 225.0 mm (0.225 m)
$   - Interior Cavity: Lead-Filled Capsule (R_in = 31.5 mm, L_inner = 288.0 mm)
$
$ Mesh Quality & Discretization:
$   - Element Type: 100% Conforming 8-node Solid Hexahedra (*ELEMENT_SOLID)
$   - Zero Degenerate Wedges / Zero Polar Singularities
$   - Interface: 100% Conforming Shared-Node Coupling between Steel & Lead
$   - Steel Casing Elements (Part 1): 3564 Hex8
$   - Lead Fill Elements (Part 2): 10773 Hex8
$   - Total Hex8 Elements: 14337
$   - Total Global Nodes: 15304
$
$ Material Models (Pure SI Units: m, s, kg, N, Pa, J):
$   1. Steel Casing (MAT_PIECEWISE_LINEAR_PLASTICITY / MAT_024):
$      - Density (RO): 7850.0 kg/m^3
$      - Young's Modulus (E): 2.10e11 Pa (210 GPa)
$      - Poisson's Ratio (PR): 0.30
$      - Yield Stress (SIGY): 3.50e8 Pa (350 MPa)
$      - Tangent Modulus (ETAN): 1.00e9 Pa (1 GPa)
$      - Failure Plastic Strain (FAIL): 0.20
$
$   2. Lead Core Fill (MAT_PIECEWISE_LINEAR_PLASTICITY / MAT_024):
$      - Density (RO): 11340.0 kg/m^3 (1.134e4 kg/m^3)
$      - Young's Modulus (E): 1.60e10 Pa (16 GPa)
$      - Poisson's Ratio (PR): 0.42
$      - Yield Stress (SIGY): 1.50e7 Pa (15 MPa)
$      - Tangent Modulus (ETAN): 1.50e8 Pa (150 MPa)
$      - Failure Plastic Strain (FAIL): 0.50
$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$
